WEBVTT

00:00:03.401 --> 00:00:05.001
You: Upload.

00:00:09.245 --> 00:00:10.945
You: Let's talk.

00:00:20.445 --> 00:00:24.645
You: What does the document say about attention? Please answer briefly.

00:00:25.472 --> 00:00:29.019
Ursly: The document says that short breaks restore attention. It

00:00:29.019 --> 00:00:32.565
recommends taking a five-minute pause after each focus session.

00:00:33.814 --> 00:00:37.014
You: How could I put that into practice during my workday?

00:00:41.173 --> 00:00:45.191
Ursly: You could set a timer for each focus session, maybe around

00:00:45.191 --> 00:00:49.209
25 to 30 minutes. Then, take a five-minute break to stretch, walk,

00:00:49.209 --> 00:00:53.227
or relax. This can help keep your attention fresh throughout the day.
